    "logic": {
      "concept": "Intraday trend following. Short-term momentum overtaking the intermediate-term trend marks the start of a directional move that other participants join over the following bars \u2014 so buy the crossover, ride the continuation, and give it back only as far as a volatility-scaled trailing stop allows.",
      "entry": "Go Long when the Fast EMA (9) crosses above the Slow EMA (21). Entry signals are only taken between 09:30 and 15:30 New York time; the fill is the next bar's open.",
      "exit": "Exit at whichever comes first: the Fast EMA (9) crossing back below the Slow EMA (21), a trailing stop 2.0 x ATR 14 below the highest price reached since the position opened, or the last bar before 16:00 New York time. No take-profit is modelled. Every exit fills at the NEXT bar's open, so the stop is an approximation with a one-bar lag and not a fill at the stop price."
    }
